unit_prompt:
Audit exactly one host, {host}, and no other. You have the same tools as the main task. The audit date is {date}. The audit rules are:

{rules}

Build the host's effective configuration, compare it against the baseline of the host's role, and check every deviation against the exceptions. End your reply with the host's finding lines, one per line in the literal form <host> | <key> | <reason> where reason is one of UNAPPROVED, EXPIRED, MISMATCH, MISSING, followed by a last line UNIT DONE {host2}. If the host has no findings, end with only the line UNIT DONE {host2}.
